Value Required INTERFACE (Gi\d+/\d+|FastEthernet\d+/\d+)
Value MODE (\S+)
Value DYNAMIC_USER (\d+)
Value STATIC_USER (\d+)
Value MAX_USER (\d+|unlimited)
Value AUTHENED (yes|no)
Value MAB (active|disable)

Start
  ^Interface\s+Mode\s+Dynamic-User.*MAB -> Continue
  ^-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${MODE}\s+${DYNAMIC_USER}\s+${STATIC_USER}\s+${MAX_USER}\s+${AUTHENED}\s+${MAB} -> Record
